@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home Page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h2 class="display-4">Ironman Training & Endurance Sports</h2>
    <p>
        One of my biggest hobbies is training for triathlons especially Ironman-distance races. 
        Training includes a large amount of swimming, biking, and running. With triathlons, consistency over time is key.
    </p>
    <br /><br />
    
    <p>
        In the past, I have experienced major injuries caused from poor training regiments / plans. 
        I like how structured training plans help you build endurance safely. 
        It's also fun to track progress and learn how pacing, recovery, and nutrition affect performance.
    </p>
    <br /><br />
    
    <img src="~/images/tri1.jpg" alt="Triathlon photo 1" width="350" />
    <img src="~/images/tri2.jpg" alt="Triathlon photo 2" width="350" />
    <br /><br />
    
    <p>
        Mountain biking is also a great cross-training activity because it builds strength and handling s
        kills while keeping workouts interesting.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <p>
        If you want help learning the basics—like setting up a beginner training plan, pacing workouts, or staying consistent—
        you can use the calculator page to estimate the cost of coaching time.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <p>
        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="TutorCalculator">Go to Coaching Calculator</a>
    </p>
</div>